  "content": "<p>蛋糕咀嚼是一款为蛋糕添加进食音效和碎屑粒子效果的模组，就像食用其他食物时那样。仅此而已。</p><h2>下载</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps-fabric/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.16.1 - 1.19.2</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric 1.19.3+</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NeoForge</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cake-chomps/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Forge</strong></a></li>\n</ul><h2>支持</h2><p>请将所有错误、问题和功能请求提交至<a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/cakechomps/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>。</p><p>非技术类支持与疑问，请加入开发者的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/JWgrdwt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>。</p><h2>许可协议</h2><p>所有源代码和资源均遵循 LGPL 3.0 许可协议。</p><h2>捐赠</h2><p>可通过<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C1NL4O\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>向开发者捐赠。</p><h2>合作伙伴</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fillusivesoulworks.com%252faffiliate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5Tw6mh2/bisect-illusive.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>",
